WEBVTT

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:04.480
Where am I?

00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:14.030
Huh?

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:16.660
Mary?

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:27.110
What? You have a present for me?

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:29.250
I'm so happy.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:30.250
What are you giving me?

00:00:34.390 --> 00:00:35.560
Wait, Mary!

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:37.140
Stop, stop, stop!

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:39.640
No!

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:51.360
Men... Men are so...

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:55.110
I'm sorry, Mary.

00:00:55.390 --> 00:00:57.320
Just kidding!

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:00.460
Why would a young wolf 
like me think that?

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:02.760
Keep going, keep going.

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:04.580
I don't have time to sleep!

00:01:12.230 --> 00:01:14.530
<i>I can't be late today.</i>

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:23.770
<b>Valentine's Day</b>

00:02:44.730 --> 00:02:45.560
Finished.

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:48.910
I managed to make it in time.

00:02:50.860 --> 00:02:53.940
I hope Shun-chan likes them.

00:02:58.330 --> 00:02:59.860
Kaname-kun...

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:01.670
Good morning.

00:03:04.470 --> 00:03:07.660
This guy's already had some chocolate!

00:03:08.070 --> 00:03:10.710
Shut up. It was from my mom.

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:13.210
I'll eat it when I get home.

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:16.220
Let go. Seriously, I'll be late to school.

00:03:16.220 --> 00:03:19.050
So what? I'm being serious, too.

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:20.180
<i>Really</i> serious.

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:21.840
You're only making it harder to eat!

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:26.970
Fine. I guess I should just 
throw it in the trash, then.

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:29.400
Sorry for giving you 
so much grief this morning.

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:33.310
Why do you have to be like this?

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:34.870
Fine, whatever!

00:03:41.590 --> 00:03:43.660
Okay, it's delicious.

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:45.020
I'm off.

00:03:46.340 --> 00:03:48.120
Kaname-kun.

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:50.660
Unbelievable.

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:53.390
Who cares about Valentine's Day anyway?

00:03:53.390 --> 00:03:54.860
It's cute...

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:58.550
Going overboard for the people you love.

00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:00.020
That's right.

00:04:00.020 --> 00:04:04.350
You'll always be a child as long 
as you don't understand women.

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:06.550
I <i>am</i> her child.

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:08.720
Stop acting like we're lovers.

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:10.290
Oh, that's right...

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:12.940
Today's Valentine's Day, isn't it?

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:16.680
Why don't we all have 
some chocolate at lunch?

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:18.680
Shun, when did you 
become a teenage girl?

00:04:18.680 --> 00:04:19.340
Huh?

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:21.550
Azuma-sensei, have this.

00:04:21.550 --> 00:04:22.910
I'm serious, don't ya know?

00:04:22.910 --> 00:04:24.570
Th-Thank you.

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:26.950
Man, what are you saying?

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:29.370
See you later, Sensei.

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:33.600
Azuma-sensei, you're so lucky.

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:36.980
You've got all that chocolate 
before we've even got a bite.

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:40.010
They say teachers are always 
role models for their students.

00:04:40.010 --> 00:04:41.180
Way to go.

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:44.230
But they feel obligated to 
give me these chocolates.

00:04:44.230 --> 00:04:45.760
To thank me for my work.

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:48.790
There you go again. 
You're always so modest.

00:04:48.790 --> 00:04:50.390
You sure did get a lot.

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:53.100
Can you eat all of those by yourself?

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:55.360
Yes. I'm happy to receive them,

00:04:55.360 --> 00:04:56.400
so I'll eat them all.

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:58.790
You'll eat every last morsel, 
and leave no one behind?

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:00.450
And leave <i>not one</i> behind.

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:03.780
Yes, yes. Whatever you say.

00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:06.530
<i>Today is Valentine's Day.</i>

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:08.430
<i>A day for boys and girls to pretend...</i>

00:05:08.430 --> 00:05:11.740
<i>they don't notice how 
anxious everyone else is feeling...</i>

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:13.200
<i>"Pretend"?</i>

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:17.080
There he is.

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:22.600
Matsuoka-kun, Yuta-kun.

00:05:23.930 --> 00:05:25.470
Takahashi-san.

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:27.630
All the girls in class got together...

00:05:27.630 --> 00:05:29.460
and made some chocolate.

00:05:29.460 --> 00:05:31.200
It's not much, but...

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:33.720
Oh, thank you.

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:35.230
Thanks.

00:05:38.990 --> 00:05:43.930
Well, that's... everything.

00:05:43.930 --> 00:05:46.910
Oh, yes. Thank you for 
specially giving me some.

00:05:52.050 --> 00:05:55.120
No, everyone got a pack.

00:05:57.130 --> 00:05:59.730
Everyone's going on about chocolate this,

00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:01.630
and chocolate that, and chocolate
 chocolate chococochoco!

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:02.960
You can't even say it anymore.

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:03.840
I don't care!

00:06:04.940 --> 00:06:08.360
A bitter man ignores 
events like this...

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:10.900
and focuses on his studies.

00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:13.010
Right, Yukki?

00:06:14.490 --> 00:06:17.270
Huh? Someone decorated my pencil case.

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:21.130
Like hell they did!

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:24.660
Yukki, you got a lot, too!

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:26.440
Damn it!

00:06:25.260 --> 00:06:26.440
Ow, ow.

00:06:29.270 --> 00:06:32.490
<i>Lucky guy. I want some chocolate, too.</i>

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:37.110
<i>I wonder if Mary's gonna 
give Shun-chan chocolate.</i>

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:41.570
<i>But maybe... just maybe...</i>

00:06:41.570 --> 00:06:44.750
<i>Maybe she'll give me some.</i>

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:49.970
<i>Maybe this morning's dream was 
a precognitive dream, or...</i>

00:07:00.740 --> 00:07:02.770
H-Hey, Mary-san.

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:06.640
What's up? You seem really tired.

00:07:06.640 --> 00:07:12.990
Yeah. I've been practicing 
making truffles every night.

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:15.180
Masaki-chan, have you not 
been getting enough sleep?

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:16.700
Did something happen?

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:20.860
No, I'm just super duper!

00:07:22.020 --> 00:07:23.520
I see.

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:27.380
Hey.

00:07:35.670 --> 00:07:38.260
Yes, yes. What is it?

00:07:38.260 --> 00:07:40.480
Well, uh... um...

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:50.650
Do you think Shun-chan 
likes... sweet things?

00:07:51.980 --> 00:07:53.890
Yeah, he does.

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:57.580
I wonder what's wrong...

00:07:58.990 --> 00:08:01.490
Anything else? Are you okay?

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:03.750
Y-Yeah, I'm fine.

00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:13.810
Huh...

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:22.930
Kaname-kun, you seem down.

00:08:22.930 --> 00:08:26.440
I was just thinking about how my 
mom's going to force me to eat...

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:29.530
all that chocolate cake 
she made when I get home.

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:31.580
Just thinking about it 
gives me heartburn.

00:08:31.580 --> 00:08:35.780
Kaname, you get all your mother's 
love as an only child.

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:37.920
It would be different if 
you had a younger brother.

00:08:37.920 --> 00:08:40.830
Why don't you tell your 
mom you want a kid?

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:41.710
Like hell I will!

00:08:41.710 --> 00:08:43.250
That means something completely different!

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:46.830
D-Did you get any chocolate today, Shun-chan?

00:08:47.090 --> 00:08:49.600
What? I never get any.

00:08:49.600 --> 00:08:54.340
My mother or sister just 
give me some every year.

00:08:55.780 --> 00:08:57.090
U-Um, excuse me.

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:05.240
I-It's a chocolate tart.

00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:07.940
I made it myself, so it's not very...

00:09:08.430 --> 00:09:11.820
I'm sure it's not any good, but...

00:09:12.960 --> 00:09:14.820
W-Well, um... if you're not...

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:19.310
dating anyone right now...

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:34.090
No, no. This is, u-um...

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:36.670
What? Come on.

00:09:36.670 --> 00:09:38.120
Don't hide it.

00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:39.810
She was from another school, wasn't she?

00:09:39.810 --> 00:09:42.110
Way to go, Shun. She was all over you.

00:09:42.110 --> 00:09:45.350
N-No, that's not it. Please stop.

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:46.680
Show us what's inside.

00:09:46.680 --> 00:09:48.170
H-Hey, wait.

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:51.450
Good for you. Does it really 
bother you that much?

00:09:51.450 --> 00:09:54.620
Huh? Well, I...

00:09:54.620 --> 00:09:56.820
I'm happy, but...

00:09:56.820 --> 00:09:59.920
Wow. It's a homemade tart.

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:01.590
It looks delicious.

00:10:01.590 --> 00:10:05.260
Hey, don't open that.

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:07.160
Mary.

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:15.010
Mary!

00:10:15.470 --> 00:10:16.840
Mary!

00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:18.980
Ma—

00:10:18.980 --> 00:10:20.090
Hey!

00:10:20.570 --> 00:10:22.550
What are you doing?

00:10:22.550 --> 00:10:24.160
Is that what I think it is?

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:25.100
Aren't those for Shun-chan?

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:27.390
You try one!

00:10:28.590 --> 00:10:30.440
What do you think you're—

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:30.790
See?

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:32.300
They taste weird, don't they?

00:10:32.300 --> 00:10:33.480
They don't taste any good, do they?

00:10:34.330 --> 00:10:36.940
I know, I'll buy something from 
the convenience store and...

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:37.740
Hey, wait.

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:38.950
Calm down.

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:43.080
Mary!

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:46.580
A-Are you okay, Mary? Mary!

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:50.080
Excuse me. Can you return our ball, please?

00:10:57.100 --> 00:10:58.920
Hold on, Mary.

00:10:58.920 --> 00:11:00.850
Don't die on me!

00:11:03.960 --> 00:11:05.930
L-Lack of sleep?

00:11:06.420 --> 00:11:08.500
She doesn't have a fever.

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:10.940
She'll be fine after some rest.

00:11:13.300 --> 00:11:14.610
I see.

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:18.780
Why'd you have to 
fall over so dramatically?

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:22.670
I have to step out for a minute.

00:11:22.670 --> 00:11:26.680
Can you walk Sato-san 
home if she wakes up?

00:11:26.680 --> 00:11:28.560
I'm a little worried about her.

00:11:28.560 --> 00:11:29.950
Ah, sure.

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:32.250
She doesn't even have a test coming up.

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:35.110
I wonder what she was 
working so hard on.

00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:26.200
Huh? Where am I?

00:12:26.200 --> 00:12:29.060
When did I fall asleep?

00:12:29.880 --> 00:12:31.390
Um...

00:12:36.050 --> 00:12:37.670
Mary, are you sure you can...

00:12:37.670 --> 00:12:38.940
What time is it?

00:12:40.240 --> 00:12:43.050
What am I going to do? I didn't 
give Shun-chan any chocolate.

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:46.660
I need to go to the convenience 
store and buy some...

00:12:47.890 --> 00:12:50.870
No, Shun-chan must have 
gone home already.

00:12:52.460 --> 00:12:54.520
It's over.

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:00.240
It's okay.

00:13:00.240 --> 00:13:01.440
Even if you can't give 
him anything today,

00:13:01.440 --> 00:13:03.260
you can still give him 
something tomorrow.

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:04.060
Okay?

00:13:04.730 --> 00:13:07.560
You should give him the 
chocolate you made.

00:13:07.560 --> 00:13:08.930
They were good.

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:10.920
Hey, Mary.

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:17.020
Hey, Mary...

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:43.180
Hey, did you really give 
that teacher some chocolate?

00:13:43.180 --> 00:13:46.020
I was so nervous.

00:13:46.020 --> 00:13:47.740
You did it?

00:13:47.740 --> 00:13:48.750
Yeah.

00:14:03.140 --> 00:14:07.280
<i>What am I doing?! What am 
I doing?! What am I doing?!</i>

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:30.930
I'm impressed you can 
eat so many sweets.

00:14:31.410 --> 00:14:34.370
Haven't you been eating all that 
chocolate you got yesterday?

00:14:37.720 --> 00:14:40.690
Yuki, you'd better return 
the sentiment on White Day.

00:14:41.250 --> 00:14:43.990
I don't think I'll have 
any left by then.

00:14:43.990 --> 00:14:45.860
Not those.

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:48.400
Shun and Chizuru, 
do you guys want some...

00:14:50.310 --> 00:14:52.590
What's wrong with them?

00:14:52.590 --> 00:14:54.400
They've been like that 
since this morning.

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:55.620
Who knows?

00:14:55.900 --> 00:14:57.950
<i>I wanna die.</i>

00:14:57.950 --> 00:15:00.780
<i>Why did I do that yesterday?</i>

00:15:00.780 --> 00:15:02.910
<i>What am I going to do 
when I see her again?</i>

00:15:03.440 --> 00:15:07.620
<i>Oh, but Mary's body was so soft.</i>

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:10.080
<i>No, I shouldn't think about that.</i>

00:15:10.730 --> 00:15:12.620
Oh, looks like Chizuru's fine.

00:15:12.620 --> 00:15:14.650
No, he must be sick.

00:15:15.820 --> 00:15:16.680
Shun.

00:15:17.280 --> 00:15:18.180
Shun.

00:15:19.510 --> 00:15:20.770
Yes?

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:23.300
What happened after that girl...

00:15:23.300 --> 00:15:25.460
confessed her feelings to you yesterday?

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:28.180
Her cell number was 
on the card, wasn't it?

00:15:28.180 --> 00:15:32.080
Oh, um... I haven't...

00:15:33.470 --> 00:15:35.210
messaged her yet.

00:15:35.210 --> 00:15:36.870
You haven't?

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:38.450
She doesn't go to our school.

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:40.120
If you don't text her, she...

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:41.960
That girl was pretty amazing.

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:45.950
It's not easy going to 
another school by yourself.

00:15:46.660 --> 00:15:48.740
I-I'm sorry.

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:51.950
I guess you don't know 
what to do when a stranger...

00:15:51.950 --> 00:15:53.940
suddenly hands you some chocolate.

00:15:53.940 --> 00:15:57.280
But we cross paths most mornings.

00:15:57.280 --> 00:16:02.050
You even picked up my 
train pass for me once.

00:16:04.820 --> 00:16:10.570
U-Um, I've got things to do, 
so I... I'm going home.

00:16:11.410 --> 00:16:12.470
Oh. Sure.

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:16.870
Is he going to be okay?

00:16:17.400 --> 00:16:19.870
It's probably the first 
time anyone's confessed...

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:21.580
their feelings to Shun before.

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:24.180
I bet he doesn't know what to do.

00:16:24.980 --> 00:16:26.420
You're probably right.

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:29.340
He's been standing there all day just thinking.

00:16:30.180 --> 00:16:32.710
What do you mean, "probably"?

00:16:32.710 --> 00:16:35.680
You should be helping him with 
his problem or something.

00:16:36.420 --> 00:16:41.240
Shun prefers to think for himself 
when he has a decision to make.

00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:42.680
Ow...

00:16:45.960 --> 00:16:47.390
What's wrong with you?

00:16:48.060 --> 00:16:49.250
Nothing.

00:16:49.990 --> 00:16:50.980
I see.

00:16:51.720 --> 00:16:54.700
I was convinced something was wrong.

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:55.960
"Something"?

00:16:58.480 --> 00:17:00.160
With your beloved Mary-chan.

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:02.840
What? How did you know?

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:06.670
How? I can tell by looking at you.

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:10.120
What happened?

00:17:10.150 --> 00:17:12.140
Nothing.

00:17:11.400 --> 00:17:13.600
What are they doing?

00:17:12.140 --> 00:17:13.600
Nothing happened.

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:15.730
Come on, why don't you tell 
Big Brother Yuki?

00:17:15.730 --> 00:17:17.180
Come on, come on, come on.

00:17:15.730 --> 00:17:17.180
Cut it out, Yukki.

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:20.140
Yukki, you'd better not 
fall in love with her, too.

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:22.390
Chizuru, where are you going?

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:24.020
I'm going home.

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:25.500
What's his problem?

00:17:26.510 --> 00:17:28.440
I won't.

00:17:48.270 --> 00:17:49.710
<i>Shun-chan.</i>

00:17:56.290 --> 00:17:58.980
<i>Shun-chan doesn't live this way.</i>

00:17:59.520 --> 00:18:01.490
<i>Where's he going?</i>

00:18:02.210 --> 00:18:04.510
<i>Sorry, Shun-chan.</i>

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:09.330
Who's that?

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:10.930
Isn't he from another school?

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:16.040
Um, is something wrong?

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:22.890
I was so surprised to see 
you standing at the gates.

00:18:22.890 --> 00:18:25.540
S-Sorry for showing up unannounced.

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:28.460
Oh, no. That's not what I meant.

00:18:29.180 --> 00:18:32.650
Um, well...

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:34.960
<i>Wh-What am I going to do?</i>

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:36.390
<i>Something crazy's going down.</i>

00:18:36.990 --> 00:18:38.470
What are you up to?

00:18:39.110 --> 00:18:40.530
Mary.

00:18:40.530 --> 00:18:42.150
Shun-chan isn't with you?

00:18:45.710 --> 00:18:49.260
You're <i>spying</i> on him? 
I can't believe you!

00:18:51.280 --> 00:18:53.610
I get it, so pipe down.

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:54.460
I'm sorry.

00:18:55.520 --> 00:18:58.390
I can't go out with you.

00:18:58.880 --> 00:18:59.860
I'm sorry.

00:19:04.150 --> 00:19:05.870
I see.

00:19:06.350 --> 00:19:08.370
Oh, it's fine.

00:19:08.680 --> 00:19:14.880
Um, I didn't really think 
it would work out, so I...

00:19:15.520 --> 00:19:17.390
I'm sorry, I guess.

00:19:17.390 --> 00:19:19.180
But I was happy.

00:19:19.950 --> 00:19:21.500
I was really happy.

00:19:23.530 --> 00:19:26.430
The chocolate tart was delicious.

00:19:26.940 --> 00:19:28.210
Thank you.

00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:34.750
I'm happy you came...

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:38.290
all the way to my school to meet me.

00:19:57.150 --> 00:19:58.350
You sure?

00:19:58.350 --> 00:20:01.970
I mean, I guess that's not 
what I really mean, but...

00:20:05.190 --> 00:20:07.790
<i>Shun-chan was always so nice.</i>

00:20:11.800 --> 00:20:15.970
<i>I always believed he would 
happily accept how I feel.</i>

00:20:16.890 --> 00:20:18.940
<i>I thought it would be so fun...</i>

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:21.880
<i>to be around him every day...</i>

00:20:21.880 --> 00:20:23.530
<i>but for the first time,</i>

00:20:24.300 --> 00:20:29.690
<i>I began to think he might 
not accept my feelings, after all.</i>

00:20:30.680 --> 00:20:33.050
<i>I was so afraid and uncertain,</i>

00:20:33.050 --> 00:20:35.000
<i>I couldn't work up the courage to do it.</i>

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:36.500
It was delicious.

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:38.500
Thank you.

00:20:38.920 --> 00:20:41.370
<i>I couldn't do it.</i>

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:04.270
A leaf.

00:21:04.270 --> 00:21:06.120
Huh? Oh.

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:08.030
Eye!

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:10.670
"Eye"? What are you...

00:21:10.670 --> 00:21:13.540
Huh? You've never made an eye shape before?

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:16.580
Sure. In elementary school.

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:17.910
I'm the left eye.

00:21:17.910 --> 00:21:20.360
Huh? Then, I'm...

00:21:20.360 --> 00:21:21.550
the right eye?

00:21:22.660 --> 00:21:25.520
You're way too short for this.

00:21:25.520 --> 00:21:26.950
What do you mean by that?!

00:21:26.950 --> 00:21:30.060
I only did it because you did!

00:21:35.300 --> 00:21:39.060
<i>My evening with you 
unfolds before my eyes.</i>

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:44.530
<i>Blindingly bright and overwhelmingly happy.</i>

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:46.570
<i>And somewhere deep inside, really frustrated.</i>

00:21:48.550 --> 00:21:50.030
I like you, Mary.

00:22:01.950 --> 00:22:03.980
Huh? Wait, Mary-san...

00:22:03.980 --> 00:22:05.630
Are you mad?

00:22:06.790 --> 00:22:09.850
Why did you have to say that?

00:22:10.320 --> 00:22:12.050
I mean, you're <i>you</i>.

00:22:12.050 --> 00:22:12.820
What?

00:22:23.860 --> 00:22:27.670
<i>I'm so happy I could cry.</i>

00:22:28.930 --> 00:22:30.810
<i>So happy I could smile.</i>

00:22:32.310 --> 00:22:35.010
<i>I'm happy that I love you.</i>

00:24:16.640 --> 00:24:19.740
Us Boys

00:24:16.860 --> 00:24:19.370
The next episode is "Us Boys."
